{% comment %}
The decider's state for confirming numbers (BuildGoal/Start.goal ConfirmNumbers): a step's code writes a number its
words don't write as digits ("retry once" → RetryCount=1). The words may give it in any language, or the number is
invented; the decider says which. Each step asked about, and each action named, with what its properties mean.
The eval's shape (tools/decider/prompt_c.py confirm_state); keep the two equal.
Needs: numbers (the UnwrittenNumber error's Details.numbers), modules (%!app.module.list%).
{% endcomment %}
{%- capture nl %}
{% endcapture -%}
A plang step is a sentence saying what to do, written in any human language. Its code is a list of actions, each
with properties. The code of each step below writes a number the step does not write as digits. A step can still
give that number in words, in any language ("once" gives 1, "twice" 2, "a minute" 60 seconds); or the number is
not in the step at all, and was invented.
{{ nl }}The steps:
{%- assign seen = "|" -%}
{%- for n in numbers -%}
{%- assign mark = "|" | append: n.Step | append: "|" -%}
{%- unless seen contains mark -%}
{{ nl }}- step {{ n.Step }}: {{ n.Text }}
{%- assign seen = seen | append: n.Step | append: "|" -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{ nl }}{{ nl }}The actions named:
{%- assign named = "|" -%}
{%- for n in numbers -%}
{%- assign mark = "|" | append: n.Action | append: "|" -%}
{%- unless named contains mark -%}
{%- assign mn = n.Action | split: "." | first -%}
{%- assign an = n.Action | split: "." | last -%}
{%- assign m = modules | where: "Name", mn | first -%}
{%- assign a = m.Action | where: "Name", an | first -%}
{%- assign about = a.Description | strip -%}
{{ nl }}- {{ n.Action }}: {{ about }}
{%- comment %} its notes, line by line: a named line as `Name — prose (builder)`, a free line as written {% endcomment -%}
{%- capture notes -%}{%- for line in a.Note.Line -%}{% if line.Name %}{{ line.Name }} — {{ line.Prose }}{% if line.Builder %} ({{ line.Builder }}){% endif %}{% else %}{{ line.Prose }}{% endif %}{% unless forloop.last %}
{% endunless %}{%- endfor -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign notes = notes | strip -%}
{%- if notes != "" -%}{{ nl }}  {{ notes }}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign named = named | append: n.Action | append: "|" -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- endfor -%}
